# The drawing sheet shown in the window (an extension, roadmap 29.1):
# the extrusion of path_extrude; View > Show Drawing Sheet shows its
# sheet in place of the model, the drawing's screen offers to show the
# model again, and choosing it does.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
menu View|Show Drawing Sheet
menu View|Drawing Sheet...
tw
twmove 455 75
twdown L 455 75
twup L 455 75
tw
save
